{'symbol': 'GPS', 'date': '2021-09-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'GAP INC. ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF $1.5 BILLION SENIOR NOTES OFFERING', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE GAP, INC. (NYSE: GPS) (“GAP INC.” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS CLOSED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED OFFERING OF $1.5 BILLION OF SENIOR NOTES (THE “NOTES”), CONSISTING OF $750 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE COMPANY'S 3.625% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2029 AND $750 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE COMPANY'S 3.875% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2031. THE NOTES WERE ISSUED UNDER AN INDENTURE, DATED AS OF SEPTEMBER 27, 2021, AMONG THE COMPANY, CERTAIN SUBSIDIA"}